      "reason": "Complete marked fork of the pinned official Models settings package. DeepSeek provider UI/editor and configuration semantics stay official; the fork adds only a read-only provider row for the independent operator-managed Cloudflare AI Gateway provider, rendering its official provider-card instead of the unknown-namespace YAML editor.",
      "sourceReviewCommit": "66491b05e3f05ad35bcdd4f6cd7ed26041d9e3db",
      "sourceEntries": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-models/src/client/ModelsSection.tsx",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-models/src/client/ProviderEditor.tsx"
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "The independent Gateway row is read-only by design; Gateway configuration is operator-managed. DeepSeek remains the official editable provider."
      ]
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes": "*",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": "*",
